  "originalOptions": "A. Implement a Cloud Function triggered by Cloud Bigtable events to export data to Cloud Storage in Parquet format.<br/>B. Use the cbt command-line tool to export data from Cloud Bigtable to Cloud Storage in Parquet format.<br/>C. Configure a BigQuery scheduled query to copy data from Cloud Bigtable to Cloud Storage in Parquet format.<br/>D. Use an Apache Beam pipeline with Cloud Dataflow to read data from Cloud Bigtable, transform it into Parquet format, and write it to Cloud Storage.",
